+**LFM3-VL-2B v3 independent audit — 2026-11-18**
+
+Scope: raw-file rescoring and code review at `64cd354be836f32c354b02b22fa8dcc69dca0ce6`, including the pre-existing working-tree changes. Independently read 580 episode pickles; exceptions count as failures. Re-ran repository offline scorers using frozen labels. Added files only; no uploads.
+
+| Claim | Status | My number / finding | Evidence path |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| C1: episode coverage and full successes | verified | Exactly 116 unique registered tasks per run. v1 **15**, v2 **3**, force-think **6**, v3 **13**, GUI-Owl **23**. Exceptions: 2 / 5 / 4 / 3 / 0. | [v3_audit/verified_aw.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/verified_aw.json), [raw hashes](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/verified_raw_manifest.json) |
+| C1: all instances match | wrong | `MarkorCreateFolder` has five different timestamped goals despite the same seed. Fourteen exception records lack seeds; every **present** seed matches the seed-30 derivation. No missing task IDs. Details below. | [v3_audit/instance_mismatches.csv](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/instance_mismatches.csv) |
+| C1: v3 half-credit / “AW mean 13.5” | wrong | `TurnOnWifiAndOpenApp` earns 0.5. **Reward sum = 13.5; mean = 0.116379 (11.638%)**. Full-success rate = 13/116 = 11.207%. | [v3_audit/verified_aw.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/verified_aw.json) |
+| C2: exact paired tests | verified | v1-only/v3-only **6/4**, p=.753906, **n=110**; v3-only/v2-only **10/0**, p=.001953, **n=107**; Owl-only/v3-only **18/8**, p=.075519, **n=112**; v1-only/force-only **9/0**, p=.003906, **n=109**. Saved JSONs agree. | [v3_audit/verified_aw.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/verified_aw.json) |
+| C3: v3 failure modes | verified | **0 answer actions; 38 complete-but-failed**. `Marker` **29** calls and `Markers` **28**, across **9** episodes; neither resolves in the native app map. `Markor` resolves and appears 5 times. | [v3_audit/card_review.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/card_review.json) |
+| C4: termination gate and GUI-Owl endings | verified | AW credits `task_successful` only if `done`. GUI-Owl: **24** endings = **13 terminate + 11 answer**, **23** full successes. | [suite_utils.py:261](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/android_world/android_world/suite_utils.py:261), [v3_audit/validation.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/validation.json) |
+| C4: `bebf929` preserves own summaries | verified | Executed parent and current summarizer on all five runs. All four LFM summaries/episode rows unchanged; GUI-Owl termination fraction changes 0 → **24/116**. | [v3_audit/summary_fix.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/summary_fix.json) |
+| C4: fix is fully correct | wrong | It still misses v2’s `SimpleCalendarNextEvent` answer ending: **40** actual self-ended episodes, summary **39**. Success totals are unaffected. | [v3_audit/validation.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/validation.json), [summarize_aw.py:69](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/eval/androidworld/summarize_aw.py:69) |
+| C5: answer-task decomposition | verified | Parsed the task protobuf and registry, traced `InformationRetrieval.is_successful` to `interaction_cache`: **25 answer tasks**, Owl **10**, v1 **0**; remaining **91**, v1 **15**, Owl **13**. v3: **0/25 + 13/91**. | [v3_audit/answer_tasks.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/answer_tasks.json), [checker:109](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/android_world/android_world/task_evals/information_retrieval/information_retrieval.py:109) |
+| C6: offline v3 scores and frozen GT | verified | AC high **.722525/8,444**, low **.901993/8,428**, terminal **.725211/1,543**; Odyssey **.662/1,000**, AMEX **.741453/468**, ScreenQA **.724/500**. Zero duplicate/missing/extra keys or label mismatches. Dev Parquet hashes match download metadata at revision `42f7f763…`. | [v3_audit/offline.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/offline.json) |
+| C6: general-knowledge arithmetic | verified | Rebuilt argmax predictions from four-option scores. MMStar **830/1500 = 55.333%**, base 782, **+3.2 pp**, lost/gained 95/143, **p=.00224673**. MMLU **500/1000**, base 489, **+1.1 pp**, 60/71, **p=.382354**. | [v3_audit/offline.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/offline.json) |
+| C6: independent frozen MMStar labels | not verified | Base/v3 IDs and gold labels agree, with no stored-prediction/correctness inconsistencies. MMLU matches independent cached test Parquet; the original frozen MMStar GT was unavailable. Its arithmetic is reproduced against recorded gold. | [v3_audit/offline.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/offline.json) |
+| C7: preview numerical results | verified | Preview’s reported evaluation numbers reproduce, including v1/v2 controls. The same training settings are recorded for all three versions. Offline metric labels need correction below. | [captured preview](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/model_card_preview.md), [v3_audit/card_controls.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/card_controls.json) |
+| C7: no AndroidWorld-derived training examples | not verified | No AW task/trajectory/checker data source found in the builders: four named datasets → v2 → intent-only v3 rewrite. AW app exclusions, executor conventions and development results **do** inform the pipeline. Only **2/16 training shards** are locally available; full-artifact absence and exact teacher/template totals cannot be certified. | [v3_audit/card_review.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/card_review.json), [build_v2_mix.py:659](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/data/build_v2_mix.py:659), [v3_build_parquet.py](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/data/v3_build_parquet.py) |
+| C8: non-significance wording and detectable difference | verified | Correct **as nominal, two-sided failure-to-reject statements**, not equivalence. For n=116, α=.05, 80% power and observed discordance: MDE **7.63 pp ≈9 tasks** versus v1; **12.70 pp ≈15 tasks** versus Owl. Actual matched n=110/112 gives **8.04/13.15 pp**. | [v3_audit/statistics.json](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/statistics.json), [independent numerical checks](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/validation.json) |
+
+The card correctly separates the matched run from the published 67.9%; the official [GUI-Owl card](https://huggingface.co/mPLUG/GUI-Owl-1.5-2B-Instruct) reports 67.9 and a larger serving configuration, and its [agent defaults to five screenshots](https://github.com/X-PLUG/MobileAgent/blob/main/Mobile-Agent-v3.5/android_world_v3.5/android_world/agents/gui_owl.py). These are different evaluation conditions; this audit does not reproduce 67.9.
+
+Instance details: `MarkorCreateFolder` uses seed **3163095783** in all runs, but folder suffixes are v1 `20261117_030335`, v2 `20261117_153954`, force-think `20261117_201810`, v3 `20261117_210853`, Owl `20261116_231457`. Missing seeds occur in these exception records:
+
+- **v1:** `RetroPlayingQueue`, `SimpleSmsSendClipboardContent`.
+- **v2:** `MarkorCreateNoteAndSms`, `MarkorDeleteNewestNote`, `RecipeDeleteDuplicateRecipes2`, `SimpleSmsResend`, `SystemBrightnessMinVerify`.
+- **force-think:** `SimpleSmsReplyMostRecent`, `SimpleSmsReply`, `SimpleSmsSendReceivedAddress`, `SportsTrackerActivitiesOnDate`.
+- **v3:** `RetroCreatePlaylist`, `SimpleSmsSendReceivedAddress`, `SimpleSmsSend`.
+
+These are missing-seed records, not demonstrated different random draws. Strict pairing excludes them. Counting them as failures by matching task ID and equal goal gives n=115 and leaves all four quoted p-values unchanged. The MDE calculation assumes independent pairs and a fixed discordance probability estimated here; n alone does not determine power. With exactly 26 discordants, a 12-task net lead crosses .05, but approximately 15 is needed for 80% power. Shared task/app structure and seed-30 model selection limit confirmatory interpretation.
+
+Defects, ranked:
+
+1. **Medium — ambiguous offline metric labels.** [Card rows 103–105](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/scripts/publish_v3_hf.py:103) should explicitly say **sampled-step SR**. AMEX .741 is not episode completion; its all-sampled-steps-correct proxy is **.322315**. Odyssey samples one step per episode. ScreenQA .724 is exact-or-token-F1≥.5 match rate; mean token-F1 is **.661671**.
+2. **Medium — incomplete paired reporting / overstatement.** [Card lines 109–111](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/scripts/publish_v3_hf.py:109) omit pair counts/exclusions. “v2’s regression is fixed” should say **v3 improves over v2 on seed-30 development tasks**; p=.754 versus v1 establishes neither restoration nor equivalence. Keep the existing development-set disclosure.
+3. **Medium — remaining termination counter bug.** [summarize_aw.py:69](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/eval/androidworld/summarize_aw.py:69) wrongly assumes LFM needs `status`; [lfm_agent.py:206](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/eval/androidworld/lfm_agent.py:206) ends on successfully executed `answer`. The v2 raw episode explicitly records `ended_by=answer`; 39/116 should be **40/116**. The GUI-Owl correction itself works.
+4. **Low — provenance claims exceed this verification.** No training contamination was found. Scope the absolute [training exclusion sentence](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/scripts/publish_v3_hf.py:120) to the documented fine-tuning sources, or retain complete pinned training artifacts for certification. Preserve frozen MMStar labels/revision for independent future rescoring. The v3-build code and cached labels support the pipeline, but only a partial training artifact was inspectable.
+
+**NO-GO on the card as written; the headline numerical results pass.** Correct the metric labels, paired reporting and inferential wording before reissuing; address the separate summarizer defect. This audit does not establish a need to retrain. Reproduction code, input hashes and detailed evidence are in [v3_audit/](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/codex/v3_audit/README.txt).
